subject = "Malwares: What are they?"
email_body = "Malware, short for ‘Malicious Software’, is a file containing scripts or commands that would run on your device after you downloaded it.[p] [p]Today we will talk about 3 types of malwares:[p] [p][b]Malware[/b] : Software that runs in the background silently. They have various goals, such as recording what you type, stealing personal information or spy on you.[p] [p][b]Adware[/b] : If it exists in your device, you will get spammed by various advertisements which can be very distracting.[p] [p][b]Ransomware[/b] : One of the most dangerous software to have in your device. It will lock your files and demand a large sum of money to unlock your files. Do not pay the ransom, it will not guarantee your files return.[p] [p]Be careful of what you download, and act quickly if your antivirus found any threats!"
